\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Documentation: Current Model Status (after augmented German fine-tuning)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
\cf0 1. Objective\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 After establishing a baseline detector trained on CubiCasa5k (640\'d7640), the goal of this stage was to 
\f0\b improve domain adaptation
\f1\b0  to German floor plans using an 
\f0\b augmented German dataset
\f1\b0  and to produce a stronger model for downstream room extraction.\
The main focus was:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 improving robustness to German drawing styles,\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 increasing recall for walls and openings,\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 and improving bounding box quality at the target resolution (1024\'d71024).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

